794
01:07:04,971 --> 01:07:06,762
<i>Delete that false claim.</i>

795
01:07:06,762 --> 01:07:10,362
<i>She's "very" pretty in person.</i>

796
01:07:11,332 --> 01:07:15,285
<i>No matter what happens,
don't let go of my hand.</i>

797
01:07:15,971 --> 01:07:17,389
