808
01:07:36,293 --> 01:07:39,557
<i>Then try to win Kang Ha Gi over.</i>

809
01:07:39,557 --> 01:07:41,303
<i>Nice to meet you too,</i>

810
01:07:41,303 --> 01:07:43,331
<i>CEO Kang.</i>

